  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase is one of the world's benchmark premium multifilament strings. Manufactured in France with over 1,400 Elastyl and H²C fibres impregnated in PU400 polyurethane and finished using the exclusive Biphase pre-stretch process, it delivers exceptional comfort, feel, power and outstanding tension maintenance while offering multiple gauges to suit different player preferences.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase 是全球最具代表性的高端多芯球线之一。法国制造，采用超过1400根 Elastyl 与 H²C 微纤维，并使用 PU400 聚氨酯整体浸润及 Biphase 双向预拉伸工艺生产，拥有极佳的力量、舒适性、击球反馈及保磅性能，同时提供 1.18、1.24、1.30、1.34 四种线径，以满足不同球员对于旋转、耐久及手感的需求。"
  },

